  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00105961_AgreementOnAcquisitionOfTangibleAssetsMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfContractualCommitmentsForTheAcquisitionOfAssetsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">보고기간말 현재 당사가 자산 취득을 위해 약정한 금액은 183,540백만원입니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:CommitmentsAmount contextRef="CFY2025eFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00105961_AgreementOnAcquisitionOfTangibleAssetsMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfContractualCommitmentsForTheAcquisitionOfAssetsTableOfMember" unitRef="KRW" decimals="-6">183540000000</dart:CommitmentsAmount>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00105961_InvestmentAgreementMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfContractualCommitmentsForTheAcquisitionOfAssetsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당사는 미래 성장분야의 신사업 기회 발굴을 위해 유안타 혁신 성장형 소부장펀드에 투자하고 있으며 향후 405백만원의 추가 투자가 약정되어 있습니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
